Good evening, my name is Abel, “ EA7KBH ”. I tell you my problem.<br>I have programmed 4 Baofeng DM 1701 walkies, but there are a couple of friends who do not hear me well. I get “full signal”, but as displaced. I have been informed in the OpenGD Telegram group, that it could be a frequency offset issue and that this fellow solved the problem, by installing the flash of one of the other DM 1701 radios “ that were working fine ”.<br><br>Will I be able to fix it this way? Does anyone know about this problem? Regards!<br><br>Translated with DeepL.com (free version)<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8025">EA7KBH</a> — Mon Feb 10, 2025 8:14 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
